          <td data-label="Value">Know your history and finances</td>
          <td data-label="Caution">May rely on older job markets</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Source"><strong>Siblings and cousins</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Value">Recent family experience</td>
          <td data-label="Caution">Limited to their field</td>
        </tr>
